.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103250.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103250.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nAdds `@export_from_dir(String directory = \"res://\")` to the list of export annotations. It exports a Resource property as a list of Resource files in a `directory`.\r\n\r\nIn the process, also adds `PROPERTY_HINT_RES_FROM_DIR` to the list of property hints.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9937.\r\n\r\n----\r\n**To do**\r\n\r\n- [X] Add new property hint\r\n- [x] Add new annotation\r\n- [x] Implement annotation effects\r\n- Update Docs\r\n    - [x] PropertyHint\r\n    - [x] Annotation\r\n\r\n----\r\n**Testing**\r\nExample project: [resource-list.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19535045/resource-list.zip)\r\n- GDScript\r\n    - [X] `@export_from_dir` is available.\r\n    - [x] Argument should be a directory path\r\n    - [x] The property it exports should be Resource or its sub-class\r\n- Editor\r\n    - [x] Shows list of files\r\n    - [x] Filtering files\r\n    - [x] Selecting file from list","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103250/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103250/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}